;    0: TWdLink(count=4043, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n400\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n400\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n140\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n140\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"The Gotos Phantom Thief Gang has arrived!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―After our bath, in the garden, cherry petals dancing on the breeze―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">we stood before the storehouse in one corner of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The secret of my eyes might be hidden in here.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Phantom Thief Captain Goto</STYLE>! No one in the vicinity!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So, </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="2">, why do we have to dress like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I am not Kana! I am Vice-Captain Phantom Thief Niimura!
{PAUSE ""}
　We disguise ourselves so our identities stay hidden, Captain!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Small as we are, dressing like this won't fool anybody...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "500" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\蔵ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"...It's locked..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Captain Goto</STYLE>! Anticipating just such a situation, I have prepared a secret item!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\鍵束.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\鍵束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> had something dangling from her hand: a ring of keys.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is the storehouse key mixed in among them?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The Niimura adults probably keep them, normally.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, it's hardly a secret item...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thanks, </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="2">. Which key is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I am not Kana! I am Vice-Captain Niimura!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I silently took the key ring and tried sticking a random key into the keyhole.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵をかける.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, it opened on the first try..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"As expected of <STYLE ID="2">Captain Goto</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
　A key is either a hit or a miss, so the odds of hitting it on the first try were 50%, were they not!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"...Sure..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I knew no one was around, but I slid the door open slowly, trying to make as little noise as possible.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">From the pitch-dark storehouse, a musty smell and dust came billowing out on the draft.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's too dark to see much...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And turning on the storehouse light would obviously give us away...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Captain Goto</STYLE>! Anticipating just such a situation!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> held out a flashlight to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I was already using my smartphone's light.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵１階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Making full use of two lights, the Gotos Phantom Thief Gang infiltrated the storehouse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There were no books or bookshelves in sight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mixed in with the junk lay a great many natas and maces.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Some were new, but there were even ones so </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="さ">rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and decayed I couldn't tell how old they were.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Captain Goto</STYLE>! Here, look at this!
{PAUSE ""}
　Could this be... treasure!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\金塊.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> brought over something that sparkled in the light.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like a gold bar, but it was awfully light.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="2">, this is gold-plated."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Geez! I told you, it's Vice-Captain Niimura!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing it was gold plating seemed to make her sulk a little.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵階段.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Stairs, further in...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They split into stairs going up to the second floor and down to the basement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So this storehouse has three levels.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="2">, can you search the second floor?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If you find any old books, tell me right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............
{PAUSE ""}
Okaaay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to have given up on the phantom thief gang setup.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe that was too cold of me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm counting on you! </STYLE>Vice-Captain Niimura<STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh...!
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
　Okay! Leave it to me, <STYLE ID="2">Captain Goto</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> ran up the stairs in high spirits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Normally, I'd be able to go along with this kind of thing...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "300" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I went down to the basement, there was a door like an iron wall.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This spot alone was strangely heavily secured...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I tried the knob, but of course it was locked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Where was the keyhole...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no keyhole.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What I saw instead of a keyhole was...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉番号.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A four-digit combination lock.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The door and the combination lock both look awfully new next to the look of this storehouse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It can only have been about 10 years since they were installed here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">10 years...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">About 10 years is only my estimate, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">10 years ago is when the first Megasawa City case happened, and when </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> was born.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And when </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> green eye turned blue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That nags at me...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh well. More importantly, how do I unlock it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This lock isn't something removable like a padlock; it's completely part of the door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Which means the door and the lock were both custom-made for this place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, the number was also set by the person who bought this door―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">most likely someone in the Niimura family chose the unlock number.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Store-bought combination locks usually come with the number already set.</STYLE><PG>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> probably wouldn't know, even if I asked her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A number that's likely tied to the Niimura family...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll just have to guess on my own.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, the date that seems connected to when this door was installed is April 8, the day of the Megasawa City case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">0</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">4</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">0</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">8, I try.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\蔵ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "300" "WAIT"}
<STYLE ID="1">No good...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">8040 got the same result.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> birthday is April 30, so...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">0</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">4</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">3</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">0―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not it...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course not...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It has to be a number </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> could never figure out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Meaning, a number that at first glance has nothing to do with the Niimura family, but is actually deeply tied to it...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if an outsider like me could ever...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, whatever. I'll just punch something in.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For example...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My birthday―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yep, that's an out, of course.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> birthday―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yep, two outs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The rest, by number wordplay... [TN: 7-2-3 can be read "na-tsu-mi" in Japanese number wordplay]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">（</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">0</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">7</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">2</STYLE>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">3）, then.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yep, of course this one's also―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵をかける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">No way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it opened...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">W-well, it's probably a coincidence. July 23 must be somebody's birthday.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉開く.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The door swung open slowly, without a sound.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Air even mustier than on the first floor flowed out from inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Like the smell of a used bookstore concentrated 100 times.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I shone my light inside...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There it was...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rows of books filled the cramped room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And every single one of them was old.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Many of them looked like Western books.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, the drug's name, falsificaso, is Portuguese.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> and her family having blue eyes, too, suggests this settlement may have had contact with a foreign land long ago.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, I'll look through all sorts of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's everything from ones that look easy to read to old script that must have been around for ages.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What I want is information about these eyes.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">This one is... about funeral practices.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With tomorrow coming up, I'll take a quick look.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I set the book on the desk in the middle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Beside it was an electric desk lamp.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Underground, there was no worry about light leaking outside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">This is a pre-Edo writing style.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And yet it isn't vertical; it's written horizontally, left to right.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's full of classical Japanese, but in my hands, stuff like this doesn't need a dictionary.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It even comes with a table of contents, how thoughtful.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Let's see, the table of contents says...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Names of the Dead</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The Role of the Witch</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The Attire of Mourners</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Falsificaso</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Reading them one by one would take time, so I'll skim through.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">To roughly sum up 'Names of the Dead'―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Those who have died are called shinigami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">The shinigami take with them those they wish to take to the next world.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">They seal their bodies in a Noh mask and a red overgarment（red robes）, and using a nata and a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="つち">hammer</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">（a mace）, they kill the living.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">How unsettling... Making trouble for people even after they're dead.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Next, 'The Role of the Witch'―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">The witch shall dress as the shinigami and protect herself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">By this, the eyes of the shinigami are deceived.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">And only the Grand Witch, who is the head, can vanquish the shinigami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">The witches support the Grand Witch while sending the shinigami back to the next world,</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> huh...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">And then 'The Attire of Mourners'―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mourners shall dress as the shinigami and the witches.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">With everyone dressed alike, the shinigami cannot tell one person from another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">From leaving home until returning, no taking anything off, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it says...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The outfit </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wore that time, if I had to pick one of these three, was probably the shinigami―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the role of killing the living.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see. Since </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> believes in the shinigami, even if someone ever saw this outfit, it could be passed off as the shinigami's doing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see, I see. It's gradually coming together.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died because </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> let a balloon fly off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">His</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> funeral was where </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would have seen the shinigami outfit, and she must have worn the Noh mask and robes there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So she has taken part in a ceremony in this outfit at least once.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I assume the culprit of the Megasawa City case is </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she probably wore the shinigami outfit when she committed those crimes, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then there's that extraordinary physical ability.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was running away when I sensed by intuition: 'She'll burn herself to death to get rid of the drug in her body.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If that drug in her body is what made that physical ability possible, it all adds up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The Megasawa City case needed at least two people doing the killing, so there must have been an accomplice.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... who would back her that far? </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> parents, maybe?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see, so that's how they were building alibis.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What a boring method. I thought it'd be something trickier, but in the end it was brute force.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">As for a motive, maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got caught up in trouble at school, like bullying?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, the victims of the case were all connected to schools, and in the first and last incidents they were kids the same age as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If the overprotective </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> decided to kill...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Ahh, what a letdown.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought the Megasawa City case culprit would have far more impressive brains and motives.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The moment I get even slightly involved in a case, I figure it out right away.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, who cares about </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">someone who got </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おび">scared</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> of me and killed herself</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll look at the last chapter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Okay, 'Falsificaso,' then.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Huh? Only the falsificaso section is in a newer writing style.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Did someone add to it later?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Let's see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Mourners shall burn falsificaso and purify both the shinigami and themselves.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">By this the curse is purified, and curse-killing can be prevented.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't quite follow what it meant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I did get that falsificaso is something like an incense offering.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But curses, curse-killing...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The way this is written, the residents fear curses and curse-killing, and not just at memorial services.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">And they purify that with this falsificaso?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, it's a strange name. Giving it a name that means 'fake'...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Which means there must be a 'real' one.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe there's information on that 'real' drug, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Isn't there a book somewhere about a drug that bears the 'real' name?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, I'll look for books that seem Portuguese.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The 'real' drug's name is probably Portuguese, too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I went back to the bookshelves and looked for a book with a likely title.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Old style or not, every one of them was written in Japanese.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If there was a spine in katakana among them, that would be the target.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After searching every corner, the one katakana spine that caught my eye.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">“The Droga Refining Method”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga does exist as a Portuguese word, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, it's a word meaning medicine or drugs.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Now then, I'll read this one too, just in case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that thick a book, so I'll probably finish it soon.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
